.Dd November 7, 2026
.Dt MKFILE 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mkfile
.Nd create files of a given size
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl nv
.Ar size Ns Op Cm b | k | m | g
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
creates each
.Ar file
at the given size.
The suffix multiplies
.Ar size
by 512 bytes, 1 KiB, 1 MiB or 1 GiB.
The suffixes may also be upper case.
Without a suffix,
.Ar size
is in bytes.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl n
Set the size without writing the blocks.
.It Fl v
Report each file created.
.El
